    "text_full": " Scheduled \n\nMay 28th, 23:30 UK / EU - Maintenance Window Fri 29 May 10AM - 11AM (ACST): INFRASTRUCTURE MAINTENANCE PLANNED: EU - 29-05-2026 10:00AM - 11:00AM ACST The expected duration of disruption is minimal; however we have set a 60 min window to complete activities.\n\n More →\n Scheduled \n\nMay 30th, 11:30 AU / NZ - Maintenance Window Sat 30 MAY 10PM - 11PM (ACST): INFRASTRUCTURE MAINTENANCE PLANNED: AU - 30-05-2026 10:00PM - 11:00PM ACST The expected duration of disruption is minimal; however we have set a 60 min window to complete activities.\n\n More →\nSkip to main content\nLEARNING RESOURCES\nWEBINARS\nSUBMIT A REQUEST\nSIGN IN\nFYI Feature Guides Apps and Integrations Microsoft 365\nMicrosoft 365\nFollow\nFollow Section\nMicrosoft 365 Integration\nAdding the FYI Add-ins to Your Practice Microsoft 365 Account\nAdding FYI Add-ins as a User from within Office and Outlook\nHow to check that FYI Add-ins for Office Products have been installed\nConfiguring your Outlook settings for FYI\nConfiguring your OneDrive for use with FYI\nLink your Practice's OneDrive Admin Account\nSummary of OneDrive Folders used in FYI\nCalendar Entry AutoFile\nIntegration with Microsoft Teams\nStay Up-To-Date\nEvents\n\nWe host a range of product demos, training webinars, workshops and more.\n\nService Status\n\nCheck for updates on the FYI Platform\n\nWhat's New\n\nRound-up of new features, fixes, and other important announcements.\n\nFYI Community\nConnect with thousands of other FYI users to discuss features and best practices, share insights, and ask questions.\nJOIN NOW\n\n© FYI | Privacy Policy | Cookie Preferences\n\nFacebook\n \nLinkedIn\nReturn to top"
